    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore a beautiful Island, filled with amazing vistas and fabulous characters.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076480/extras/86f522621fa73805fed521508a8be409.poster.avif?t=1726727025\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076480/extras/86f522621fa73805fed521508a8be409.webm?t=1726727025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076480/extras/86f522621fa73805fed521508a8be409.mp4?t=1726727025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Talk to the locals, collect silver shells and trade them for better equipment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deliver mail, dig up treasure and fly around using the legendary postal delivery umbrella.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076480/extras/82be42257cd350052d35e6691ec1c0d5.poster.avif?t=1726727025\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076480/extras/82be42257cd350052d35e6691ec1c0d5.webm?t=1726727025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076480/extras/82be42257cd350052d35e6691ec1c0d5.mp4?t=1726727025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The local post office needs your help. Overcome various obstacles and find helpful tools to traverse the island.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore secret locations and fight dangerous bug creatures.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076480/extras/3be65e75231b210dbc62ac9ace0d3c2e.poster.avif?t=1726727025\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076480/extras/3be65e75231b210dbc62ac9ace0d3c2e.webm?t=1726727025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076480/extras/3be65e75231b210dbc62ac9ace0d3c2e.mp4?t=1726727025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>This land may look peaceful but not all of its inhabitants are kind ;)",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore a beautiful Island, filled with amazing vistas and fabulous characters.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076480/extras/86f522621fa73805fed521508a8be409.poster.avif?t=1726727025\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076480/extras/86f522621fa73805fed521508a8be409.webm?t=1726727025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076480/extras/86f522621fa73805fed521508a8be409.mp4?t=1726727025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Talk to the locals, collect silver shells and trade them for better equipment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deliver mail, dig up treasure and fly around using the legendary postal delivery umbrella.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076480/extras/82be42257cd350052d35e6691ec1c0d5.poster.avif?t=1726727025\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076480/extras/82be42257cd350052d35e6691ec1c0d5.webm?t=1726727025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076480/extras/82be42257cd350052d35e6691ec1c0d5.mp4?t=1726727025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The local post office needs your help. Overcome various obstacles and find helpful tools to traverse the island.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore secret locations and fight dangerous bug creatures.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076480/extras/3be65e75231b210dbc62ac9ace0d3c2e.poster.avif?t=1726727025\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic